[
  {
    "id": "d01a76a19a8cb485",
    "text": "Remove the screws on the left side",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "1742cd8c886cd3c5",
    "text": "of the cover (",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "5802c004db5f42be",
    "text": "The screws on the right side are identical to those on the left—",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "3834e399e792ed3d",
    "text": "remove them as well",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "0ece55a001623765",
    "text": "Installation Process",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "eb1dcf6ee2c25bf2",
    "text": "Step 3: Replace the Poly-carbonate Cover",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "aa9ca9a37911ef4e",
    "text": "Carefully remove the old cover",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "b20049ebe1e5fbc8",
    "text": "by slightly flexing the",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "936efe01a88e1b2e",
    "text": "poly-carbonate sheet",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "ea4700c5cea76dc7",
    "text": "to unhook it from its seated position.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9705bad2fccb76e",
    "text": "Position the new poly-carbonate cover",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "41531bb0b824af5f",
    "text": "and gently flex it as needed to align it with the mounting points.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "7cace29d99ed899b",
    "text": "Secure the cover",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "558a8c979186f5c3",
    "text": "by reinstalling and tightening all screws.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "5c47cf4ed9053121",
    "text": "Remove the sticky tape",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "c18ec8efac5a4d9e",
    "text": "from the top button and ensure it remains correctly positioned.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "67f62963fb2a8d2c",
    "text": "Final Check",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "e766a1849842f324",
    "text": "Ensure the new cover is",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "d8f957aae9e26953",
    "text": "firmly secured",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "5253900b53838ad6",
    "text": "and properly seated.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "fb724e25080e5c2a",
    "text": "Verify that the",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "1522fb3db05f7649",
    "text": "top button remains functional",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "ecbb7ebaee2d3982",
    "text": "and correctly positioned.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
    "id": "1a6f85543438d876",
    "text": "The replacement process is now complete, and the Carvera Air is ready for use.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/Air/Maintenance/replace_polycarb_top"
  },
  {
